# commloss_takeoff.scn — the link is lost during a TAKEOFF that does not complete: after the hover grace the state goes to LANDING
#                        完了しない TAKEOFF の間にリンクが途絶える: ホバーの猶予の後、状態は LANDING になる
#
# STABILIZE, weak motors (health 0.9), the throttle above the takeoff threshold but below the hover thrust (raw 3100), and the ToF dead zone OFF (`tof_deadzone 0`: the sensor reads the
# floor validly, so the ToF-based airborne verdict stays false): the manual TAKEOFF does not complete. The link is lost 0.5 s into the TAKEOFF (the 8 s gap below). Before this rule
# the comm-loss landing fired in FLYING only, so such a craft stayed in TAKEOFF for ever on the stale command (a STABILIZE takeoff whose ToF output stopped, with the link lost, climbed to 2.76 m in SILS and the motors stopped in the air). Spec under test
# (detailed_design.md §3.1, comm-loss row; takeoff_policy.hpp decideCommLossLanding()): COMM_LOST arms the 3 s hover grace; once it has elapsed, TAKEOFF -> LANDING (the same as FLYING).
#
# STABILIZE、弱いモータ（健全度 0.9）、スロットルは離陸の閾値より上でホバー推力より下（生値 3100）、ToF の不感帯は切る（`tof_deadzone 0`: センサが床を有効に読むので、ToF による
# 空中の判定は偽のまま）: 手動の TAKEOFF は完了しない。リンクは TAKEOFF の 0.5 s 後に途絶える（下の 8 s の空白）。以前は、通信断の着陸は FLYING でしか働かなかったので、そのような
# 機体は古い指令のまま TAKEOFF に永久に留まった（ToF 出力停止の STABILIZE 離陸に通信断を足すと、SILS で 2.76 m まで上昇し、空中でモータが止まった）。検証する仕様（detailed_design.md §3.1 の通信断の行。takeoff_policy.hpp の
# decideCommLossLanding()）: COMM_LOST が 3 s のホバー猶予を起動し、経過したら TAKEOFF → LANDING（FLYING と同じ）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/commloss_takeoff.scn --target vehicle --duration 22000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    tof_deadzone 0
   0    fault 0 0.9
   0    fault 1 0.9
   0    fault 2 0.9
   0    fault 3 0.9
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50                       # B: ARM (4.0 s), STABILIZE
   +    rc         3100  2048   2048    2048  1     500       50                       # C: throttle above the takeoff threshold, below the hover (5.0 s): TAKEOFF on the floor
   +8000 rc        3100  2048   2048    2048  1     300       50                       # D: 8 s of silence on the link (5.5-13.5 s) -> COMM_LOST -> 3 s hover grace -> LANDING (about 9 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     300       50                       # E: release the ARM button
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # F: settle
